{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/za/reviews/id702680435"}, "name":{"label":"pandajaym17"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-01-09T20:49:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.37"}, "id":{"label":"10804740853"}, "title":{"label":"What a great app ✨"}, "content":{"label":"My person and I downloaded the app because 1- were doing long distance and 2 because we’ve just started our relationship. \n\nIt’s been a great part of our relationship so far and we use it every day. There’s a feature to add important dates - like the first day we met each other. Being able to have those is a really wonderful reminder of where we started and just being able to look back at those moments. \n\nThere’s questions to get to know each other in a fun and interactive way and there’s a new daily question prompt. \n\nOne of the main reason I chose this app over the rest is because of the UI (how it looks) - it’s clean and just looks so great compared to some of the other apps available. \n\nThere’s also date reminders and a distance widget so you can see how far away from you are from your partner. So great. \n\nHighly recommend !", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/za/review?id=1624758651&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}], "updated":{"label":"2026-10-04T03:32:46-07:00"}, "rights":{"label":"Copyright 2008 Apple Inc."}, "title":{"label":"iTunes Store: Customer Reviews"}, "icon":{"label":"http://itunes.apple.com/favicon.ico"}, "link":[
